<title>FINLAND: UPM-Kymmene says started U.S. ADRs.</title>
<headline>UPM-Kymmene says started U.S. ADRs.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forestry group UPM-Kymmene Oy said on Thursday it had launched a programme to trade American Depositary Receipts in its shares on U.S. OTC markets.</p>
<p>&quot;The level 1 ADR programme does not mean that the company will become listed on the (New York) stock exchange,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
